# Cloudflare Pages: the app's own paths load the app (status 200, the address stays); anything else is a real 404
# (404.html). Party links get the invite shell, whose link preview is an invitation (src/pages/invite.astro).
# Every route in the app and every link the API emails (/enter/link, /profile/delete, /profile/email, /p/<code>/)
# must be covered here.
/p/*        /invite/  200
/profile    /         200
/profile/*  /         200
/enter      /         200
/enter/*    /         200
/rolled/*   /         200
/new        /         200
/new/       /         200
/join       /         200
/join/      /         200
